nvert into jars of mystery fluid that can be used in the store to buy different skins, rocket trails and even kill emotes for your character.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1315660/extras/ae9a806c48b0bc7e1c66995269235a85.poster.avif?t=1676764574\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1315660/extras/ae9a806c48b0bc7e1c66995269235a85.webm?t=1676764574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1315660/extras/ae9a806c48b0bc7e1c66995269235a85.mp4?t=1676764574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thrust Yourself to Victory</h2><br>Just wanted an excuse to write this.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1315660/extras/b087b49af87c2b10908f424083528436.avif?t=1676764574\" /></div>",
